        "content": "## 05 Email Mesh - Receipt Review Discovery and Notifications\n\nfinancial_review_hook.py --notify-only: discover quarantined receipts, persist revisions and notify the authorized admin. No approval or financial publication is synthesized here. Trusted /bxconfirm /bxretry /bxreject input remains in the existing Telegram plugin; the main pipeline consumes validated approvals using the canonical publisher.\n\n**COPY ONLY — inactive by default.** Every action defaults to `preview`; explicitly select `inspect` for read-only checks. Do not cut over while the old scheduler is enabled. Live mode additionally requires `BUDGETX_N8N_ALLOW_LIVE=1` on the n8n service. Config, OAuth, Firebase Admin and financial state remain in private host files. These are n8n orchestration workflows reusing the existing Python engine, not a rewrite of ledger logic into JavaScript nodes.",
